        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9006/440, Back-To-Back Modern Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Back-to-Back Pull Set is made up of a pair of 17-5/16 c.c. door pulls packaged with back to back mounting hardware. The Back-To-Back Modern Door Pull Set is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, or polished chrome finishes. The Omnia Ultima I 9006P Back-to-Back Door Pull Set is great for modern decors in both residential or commercial applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia  Ultima I 9006P/440 Door Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-5/16\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9006P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/modern-17-5-16-handles-for-front-doors-omnia-9006p-440\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2) Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
